### Case: write-no-key — each write method with no key.
### Expect 401 "Missing API key in request" from all three. The backend is never
### called. A 2xx on any one means that write route has no key check.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/catalog/items
content-type: application/json

{"title":"Trail running shoe","price":89.5}

###
PUT {{GATEWAY}}/catalog/items/1
content-type: application/json

{"id":1,"title":"Trail running shoe","price":79.5}

###
DELETE {{GATEWAY}}/catalog/items/1
